1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Lo dilî milyon e kekê dilî milyon e, dilî milyon e.
 
Oh heart is a million brother, heart is a million, heart is
a million.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Serê min bi qurban o, di deh hezar û deh û heşta da bi destê
xavirdar û di dewran a giran e.
 
Let my head be a sacrifice, in two thousand and eighteen, by
the hands of the traitor and in this heavy era.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Hem hem hem.
 
Hmm hmm hmm.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Wê lê Ayşê...
 
Oh Ayşe...

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Em kê nêzîk da warin navî wa bixwînin, kê wê derê, bi rêkê
kî me ra alîkarî kirî, em kê warin navî wa binivîsin, bidin
wê derê.
 
We will come close and read their names, who is there,
through whoever helped us, we will come and write their
names, put them there.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Ji qîza xalkê me ra û Malik ra heta, heta wê derê û Xwedê ji
wan razî be, heta gundî...
 
From our uncle's daughter and Malik up to... up to there,
and may God be pleased with them, up to the villagers...

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
... kî tevlî vî karî bûn e, Xwedê ji wan jî qebûl bike.
 
... whoever participated in this work, may God accept it
from them too.

8
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Hemû dera çêkin.
 
Fix everywhere.

9
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Ewê xwe çêkirastî, me gûniyê xwe goxeyê xwe... min lo
şebabên gundî xwa bo bixwînin û...
 
The ones who made it themselves, with our own sacks and
hoes... I call on the youth of our village to read it and...

10
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Ev Ebdoyê pê da e. Ev Ebdoyê pê da e.
 
This is Ebdo, go ahead. This is Ebdo, go ahead.

11
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Sêr ke, evê ha lo xwişk û birano.
 
Look, it's like this, brothers and sisters.

12
00:00:47,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Sêr ke dikêlawa em saetekê tim navo digerin, nav ko kincan
da derdînin e, xweyî nîne lê.
 
Look, on their tombstones, we search for names for an hour,
we bring them out from the mud, there is no owner for them.

13
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Dembaş xwişk û birano, dîsa em hatin vîdyoyê xwaş û kibar.
 
Good day brothers and sisters, we came again with a nice and
elegant video.

14
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Arê xwîşk û birano vîdyoya me jî îro em kê herin darbazî
nahiyeyê Şera bin.
 
Yes brothers and sisters, our video today we will pass
through the sub-district of Shera.

15
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Em kê derbaz gundê Çema bin û Şera.
 
We will pass to the village of Çema and Şera.

16
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Navê Ebdoy. Tabî xelkê me bi rêkê kî me ra teberu kirin e,
ji miletê gundî xwa ra teberu kirin e...
 
The name is Ebdo. Of course our people who donated through
us, they donated for the people of their village...

17
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,000
... ji miriyên xwa ra, em kê herin darên wan li wê derê
mantiqê biçînin.
 
... for their dead, we will go plant their trees in that
area.

18
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Navê Ebdoy jî ey me ra xeber de, navê muteberîyo...
 
The name is Ebdo too, he informed us, the name of the
donors...

19
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:31,000
Tabî saeta şebabê xwaş dîsa grûpê me ro amade ye.
 
Of course, well done to the youth, our group is ready for us
again.

20
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Saeta xalûyê jî xwaş, Xwedê jê razî be.
 
Well done to the uncle too, may God be pleased with him.

21
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:36,000
Xalû tiştekî ji gundî mesajna tiştna nakî?
 
Uncle, won't you send any message or anything to the
village?

22
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,000
Maşallah saeta wa xwaş... grûpê...
 
Mashallah... bless them... the group...

23
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Sê sed û şêşt û şeş gund o... na wê yê?
 
Three hundred and sixty-six villages... isn't that right?

24
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Arê. Bêyî musaheme be vî... xêrkirinê wa... miriyê wa ra...
bi xêr û xweşkirina vî mubederê wa. Saet xweş.
 
Yes. Without hesitation with this... their good deeds... for
their dead... with the good and pleasantness of this
initiative of theirs. Well done.

25
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Saet xwaş, saet xwaş xalo, Xwedê ji te razî be.
 
Well done, well done uncle, may God be pleased with you.

26
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Saeta te jî xwaş, Xwedê ji te razî be.
 
Well done to you too, may God be pleased with you.

27
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:57,000
Tabî em li vî derê ca qehwokê xwa... xalû sivik in, me av
da, girt em go em herin qehweya xwa jî vexwin...
 
Of course, we are here now... uncle is quick, we watered it,
closed it, we said let's go drink our coffee too...

28
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:59,000
... destpêkê, em kê herin ne?
 
... first, we will go, right?

29
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,000
Ebdoy, navê muteberîya xeber da me ro.
 
Ebdo, tell us the names of the donors.

30
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:06,000
Muteberî qîza Eyşê ya, Samiya,
 
The donor is Ayşe's daughter, Samiye,

31
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:08,000
û kulfetî gundê Malik won a.
 
and the woman of the village, Malik and them.

32
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Silavê me ji xwişka me Samiya re.
 
Our greetings to our sister Samiye.

33
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:16,000
Samiya û kekê me Malik, silavê me ji yê ra hene, ez dibêjim
rehma li miriyê wa bin, ciyê wan cenet be.
 
Samiye and our brother Malik, we have greetings for them, I
say may there be mercy on their dead, may their place be
paradise.

34
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Ê kê ... hare ... ji bo rihê kî...
 
And who... is it for... for whose soul...

35
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Ji bo rihê Zahîde, Tirik.
 
For the soul of Zahide, Tirik.

36
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:22,000
Û Eyşê Ibrahîm Tirik.
 
And Ayşe Ibrahim Tirik.

37
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:27,000
Û Mihemed Cabû, îbn Zuheyde û Ciwan îbn Zuleyxe. Ê kê hare
ev xêra wa bo rihê wana be.
 
And Mihemed Cabu, son of Zuheyde and Ciwan son of Zuleyxe.
This good deed of theirs will go for their souls.

38
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,000
Bû rihê wa na, em kê biçînin.
 
For their souls, we will plant.

39
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:36,000
Xwedê qebûl ke, rehma li mirîyê te bin kekê Malik û xwişka
me em silavên me ji wa ra hene heta ciyê wa Danîmark.
 
May God accept it, may there be mercy on your dead brother
Malik and our sister, we have greetings for them all the way
to their place in Denmark.

40
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:38,000
Çavê kî wa macî dikim.
 
I kiss their eyes.

41
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:41,000
Silavê me ji miletê Şera ra û Çema gîşkê ra hene, tabî. Na
wilo xalo?
 
Our greetings to the people of Şera and Çema, to all of
them, naturally. Isn't that so uncle?

42
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,000
Çûçik, mezin, kal, pîr.
 
Young, old, elderly men, elderly women.

43
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:53,000
Na? Arê. Bî me ra bin xutwe bi xutwe. Em ê noka herin
vîdyokî xwa çêkin, dest pê kin. Û bî me ra bin. Bye bye.
 
Right? Yes. Be with us step by step. We will now go make our
video, start it. And be with us. Bye bye.

44
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:59,000
Arê xwîşk û birono, li vî derkê jî em gîştine ser tirbê
Çema.
 
Yes brothers and sisters, here we have arrived at the
cemetery of Çema.

45
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:02,000
Ser tirbê Çema, bi rastî xezîneyek av ha ye.
 
At the cemetery of Çema, truly there is a treasure like this
here.

46
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:08,000
Welle gundekî pir xwaş û kibar e, her gunda jî, me caro na
hatine bi serhedatê...
 
By God it's a very beautiful and nice village, for every
village too, we've never come to visit it properly before...

47
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:16,000
Me kê hûr û av bifiranda... doran me kê bifiranda. Izin bi
me re tin e bi serhedatê, arê.
 
We would have cut this down deeply... we would have cut
around it. We don't have permission frankly, yes.

48
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:20,000
Izn tin e em bifirînin...
 
There is no permission for us to cut it down...

49
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:25,000
Berî vê izn, me ewa dikir, me difirandin a ev hûr û izn tin
e. Lênî em nikarin em darin her darekî bifirinîn.
 
Before this permission, we used to do that, we used to cut
them down, but now there is no permission. Because we can't
just go and cut down every tree.

50
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:31,000
Hata ez warqê çêdikim, navê xwa qeyid dikim, çîçka şebabê
navî me da yê...
 
Until I make the papers, until I register my name, a bit of
the youth's name is with us...

51
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:35,000
Ewa har... her darekî yakî ne cem şebabên vî derê av dikin.
 
Those every... every tree, someone from the youth here is
watering it.

52
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:39,000
Maşallah.
 
Mashallah.

53
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:45,000
Şebabê vî derê î navo sad dikin... rehmetî yo.
 
The youth here are searching for the names... of the
deceased.

54
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:48,000
Ha, arê hevalo.
 
Ah, yes friends.

55
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:52,000
Vê derê kê ji, sêr ke. Ev a xaltîka min a? Loqman?
 
Here too, look. Is this my aunt? Loqman?

56
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:54,000
Arê arê.
 
Yes, yes.

57
00:03:54,000 --> 00:04:02,000
Ev xaltîkeya gilek darekî mo azin kirne bar serê, weş hişk
bîlîne, wale hişko.
 
This aunt... we have prepared a lot of trees at the head of
her grave, it's dried out, see it's dry.

58
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:12,000
Bînê! Xwedê rehma xalê ke, cî xwa cinet be. Hamû daş derxîn
e... yak hecer te ok û meqbî... qurtê mezin çê ke.
 
Look! May God have mercy on the aunt, may her place be
paradise. Take out all the stones... just one stone... dig
it a bit bigger.

59
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:18,000
Ne herin wa daro. Wa doran e mezin. Em na mişkiloka xwê yo,
mişkiloka xwê yo.
 
Don't go to those trees. Those are big trees. These have
their own problems, their own problems.

60
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:23,000
Her dîndaran o. Hamo dîn daro ham dî... hamo fêre çêkê.
 
They are everywhere. All of them... again... make this wide.

61
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:25,000
Çend sal e miriye Ebdoy wisa?
 
How many years has it been since she died, Ebdo, like this?

62
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:27,000
Ew salo de hezar û bîst û sê.
 
That was the year two thousand and twenty-three.

63
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:28,000
De hezar û bîst û sê... rehmetî bi na?
 
Two thousand and twenty-three... the deceased, right?

64
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:31,000
Xwedê rehma xwe lê ke, cî wê cenet be.
 
May God have mercy on her, may her place be paradise.

65
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:40,000
Arê. Xakê me, Xwedê rehma xwe lê ke, cî wê cenet be. Qurtê
mezin bikin hevalno, ev jî ya avle ya hişk biyo...
 
Yes. Our aunt, may God have mercy on her, may her place be
paradise. Dig it a bit bigger friends, this one here has
also dried up...

66
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:46,000
Av, av kîjin o ye?
 
Water, which one is it?

67
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:47,000
Ev o Mehemed e?
 
Is this Mehemed?

68
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:49,000
Ev a Mehemed e û Ciwan e won a.
 
This is Mehemed and Ciwan and them.

69
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:51,000
Haa, Mehemed û Cwan e.
 
Ah, Mehemed and Ciwan.

70
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,000
Ev o Mehemed e, ev a Cwan e.
 
This is Mehemed, this is Ciwan.

71
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:56,000
Av o Mehemed, av o Cwan e. Xwedê rehma xwe lê ke, ciyê wa
cinet be.
 
This is Mehemed, this is Ciwan. May God have mercy on them,
may their place be paradise.

72
00:04:56,000 --> 00:05:01,000
Sêr ke. Darê bar do hişk bî ye, ho. Têdî, ha. Hişk bî ye.
 
Look. The previous tree has dried out, see. Inside, see.
It's dried out.

73
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:05,000
Xêr e, çi ecêb e vî dar na hişk bîn e wan o mezin.
 
Why is it that strangely these trees have dried out, these
big ones.

74
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:07,000
Dî av neda wan a.
 
They didn't water them.

75
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:12,000
Dê wale xalo na maseletê avê ya, mişkilê xa ya, ama dorên
mat sa ke ha wa kokê xa çasa qalinda.
 
By God uncle, it's not a matter of water, it's their own
problem, but look at our tree here, see how thick its roots
are.

76
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:24,000
Ma têçelihiyê avî no do çandine, çeliyê avî mad i çînin a,
em çûne dorên wa gî geraştin e, darê me qe hişk nabin. Gund
î zawî ne ev ji di çeliyan da ye maşallah aw... germê da.
 
We planted it from those saplings, we plant water saplings,
we went around them, our trees never dry up. The village is
an angle, this is also from the saplings, mashallah that...
in the heat.

77
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:30,000
Awa dor na mişkilê xwa ya awa nişansê jî hold am a.. hişq
nabe yaq idio...
 
And these trees have their own problems. It's a matter of
luck too... mostly... they don't dry out one by one...

78
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:34,000
Xalo te ci silav heye da şînî ji me ra... milet re.
 
Uncle, do you have any greetings to send, for us... for the
people.

79
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:38,000
Ez silavo ji miletê xwe, heta çar perçe Kurdistan re
dişînim.
 
I send my greetings to my people, across the four parts of
Kurdistan.

80
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:43,000
Em hurmet dikin şehîdê xwa li çar perçê Kurdistanê.
 
We pay respects to our martyrs in the four parts of
Kurdistan.

81
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:46,000
Hîro li binya mazelê gundê Çema.
 
Today below the cemetery of Çema village.

82
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:50,000
Malê xa bi de cavî mesken o cavî zozan o.
 
Let them look at their homes, it is the eye of dwellings and
the eye of the highlands.

83
00:05:50,000 --> 00:06:00,000
Li binî gundê me, gundê barawa sed o meydankê, li hafê me
dixwîn e bilbil û şalûl û kûkê daxan o.
 
Below our village, the Arab villages, a hundred squares,
around us sing the nightingales, blackbirds, and cuckoos of
the mountains.

84
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:05,000
Dinyo payîz e dawiyê çeliyê daran e, dilî mi ji we ro dêyan
e.
 
The world is autumn, the end of the trees' withering, my
heart aches for them.

85
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:10,000
Dilî milyon e kekê dilî milyon e, dilî milyon e, serê mi bi
qurban o.
 
The heart is a million brother, the heart is a million, the
heart is a million, let my head be a sacrifice.

86
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:17,000
Di de hezar û deh û heşto da bi destê xavirdar şê dest da mi
dewron o giran e.
 
In two thousand and eighteen, by the hands of the traitor,
the heavy era fell into my hands.

87
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:25,000
Me barê xwa da hafê gundê wa sîteyê mal o xirab e... me
rûniştin li bin taht û zinaro ne.
 
We set our loads beside the village by that ruined house's
wall... we sat under the rocks and cliffs.

88
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:33,000
Em rûniştin ne piştî xwa da... hevşûdî yar o... malê mi
şewitî me hesir bar da, yarim ji hevdî çab o na ye.
 
We sat with our backs... together oh beloved... my home
burned, we shed tears, my beloved did not show her face.

89
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:36,000
Yarim kal o, pîro, melşîno, me mo ne... saroko atfalo... me
hîna ne.
 
My beloved is old, grieving, we remained... leaders and
children... we have them.

90
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:44,000
Dibe bera berê keço bî kon o... la heyterîs babo tê xira...
eşqa miletê me kurdan e.
 
Let them go first, the girls in tents... oh father, it's
ruined... the passion of our Kurdish people.

91
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:50,000
Yarim tu ji me ra ne biyî siltan Silêman o, te hukum dikir
li hîns û li cîns û li perîyan o.
 
Oh beloved, you didn't become Sultan Suleiman for us, you
ruled over mankind, jinn, and fairies.

92
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:56,000
Çimo salo nehlekê mal o mi şewitî çavê me birçîn e, te har
bû cengo dikî bi va miletê me kurdan e.
 
Why for cursed years did my home burn, our eyes are hungry,
you go wage war against our Kurdish people.

93
00:06:56,000 --> 00:07:03,000
Malê xwa bidê tirbê di şehîdê me yorim... tij teyî dikî gûl
o gîyê dardo xaniyê peyono...
 
Let them look at the graves of our martyrs, oh beloved...
you are clearing the dirt and grass... the sorrow of the
fallen houses.

94
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:15,000
Roha honî şehîdê mi dilî mi honî... ko dî salo nû di susyo
da ko keçik a û berîvon o, ronohî timo ji bovo miletê kurdan
agîr ber da vî mîcono.
 
The root of my martyrs' house, my heart's house... where are
the new years in... where the girls and milkmaids and the
light, always for the Kurdish people, set fire to this
gathering.

95
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:25,000
Go bi hezar û hestî babo kalo, şket û berqefo ciwano
hoydo... lê dilê, lê dilê, lê dilê...
 
Saying with thousands and bones, fathers and grandfathers,
from caves and cliffs, youth... oh heart, oh heart, oh
heart...

96
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:31,000
Way dilê lê, ji birînom xayînî dar o... ham, ham, saet xweş.
 
Oh heart, oh, from my wounds, the traitor's tree... yes,
yes, well done.

97
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:36,000
Guro yarim ji hezar û hestî bobo kalo ji şketo berqefo, me
ji joro deranî...
 
The wolves, my beloved, from thousands and bones, fathers
and grandfathers from caves and cliffs, we brought them out
from above...

98
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:41,000
Heyfa bavê qadî Mihemed o Şêx Saîd, Mela Mistefa Barzanî.
 
Pity for father Qazi Muhammad, Sheikh Said, Mela Mustafa
Barzani.

99
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:50,000
Yarim hîro me joro bi şehîd li qey xo mi ji ber da, miletê
kurda bi xwînê xa dan, yarim helan o.
 
My beloved, from up here, with martyrs falling, the Kurdish
people gave with their blood, my beloved is melting.

100
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:58,000
Lo kekê dilî milyona, dilî milyona dinyo sare zivistane,
diweşe çilî daxan o.
 
Oh brother, the heart is a million, the heart is a million,
the world is cold, it's winter, the leaves of the mountains
are falling.

101
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:06,000
Hîro ma serê xwa danî ya binya mazelê giran e bi qurbano, me
destê xwa berda dest dî dewran o giran o.
 
Today we laid our heads below the heavy cemetery, let me be
a sacrifice, we let go of our hands from hands, mouth and
the heavy era.

102
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:14,000
Tirso dikim xerîb wellehî toy... serê xvî diynî hevçî qebro
raş o tarî. Yarim ji binî ser wondo ware çele zivistan o.
 
I fear, stranger, by God you are... you lay your head in the
dark and black grave. My beloved, from under their heads,
come it's the forty days of winter.

103
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:21,000
Çil kirtî evro ne, û birîsko bi ser wan do, wara lopokî
berfê û tip û tipê baran o.
 
Forty days of frost today, and lightning over them, come the
flakes of snow and the drip-drop of rain.

104
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:28,000
Welleh nobe kekê navo babo navo, gelî heval û cîran û xêribo
welleh ti navî.
 
By God it cannot be, brother it cannot be, father it cannot
be, oh friends and neighbors and strangers, by God it cannot
be.

105
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:34,000
Yek bi yeko herin ro... wilo bi xaniyê xwa ke... kê gir bê
mal o xirab e...
 
One by one go out... build your houses like that... whoever
cries, oh ruined home...

106
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:38,000
Lo kekê dilî milyon e, kekê dilî milyon e, heyfa wan li xwa
bidî xwaş heşerat o...
 
Oh brother, the heart is a million, brother the heart is a
million, pity on them taking revenge, the revenge of the
insects...

107
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:44,000
Gundê me yaram cîy û hewş û heyata me biye qulî mişk û maran
o.
 
