00:19:55,000 --> 00:20:13,000
Bi lev a der.. bi lev a der.. amade kim..
 
With the edge outside.. with the edge outside.. let me
prepare it..

216
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:17,000
Na tişt nabe.
 
No, it doesn't matter.

217
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:23,000
Ha şemskê qulap bike, kê!
 
Pull the weed, man!

218
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:27,000
Bêrê, yekî hilde.
 
The shovel, someone take it.

219
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:29,000
Ha wilo.
 
Yes, like that.

220
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:33,000
Kopê bar de.
 
Let down the cup.

221
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:41,000
Kopê bar de.
 
Let down the cup.

222
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:46,000
Erê xwişk û birano, em dîsa hatin goristana gundê Şara.
 
Yes, brothers and sisters, we have come again to the
cemetery of the village of Şara.

223
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:51,000
Taxa... Dêka Abu Ibrahîm û...
 
The neighborhood... Mother of Abu Ibrahim and...

224
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:54,000
Dêka Abu Ibrahîm, kekê Abu Ibrahîm.
 
Mother of Abu Ibrahim, brother of Abu Ibrahim.

225
00:20:54,000 --> 00:21:00,000
Maşallah, xwedê emrê we dirêj bike.
 
Mashallah, may God prolong your lives.

226
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:03,000
Xwedê ji we razî be û xwedê we xêr û xêrata we qebûl bike.
 
May God be pleased with you and may God accept your charity
and good deeds.

227
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:07,000
Saet û melek ji we xweş be. Sed melek ji we xweş be.
 
May hours and angels be pleased with you. A hundred angels
be pleased with you.

228
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:10,000
Dê û bavê we rehma xwedê lê be, di bihiştê de bin inşelleh.
 
May God's mercy be upon your mother and father, may they be
in heaven, God willing.

229
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:15,000
Em silavên xwe ji Malîk re jî dişînin. Û ji kilfeta gişta.
 
We send our greetings to Malik too. And to the whole family.

230
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:19,000
Û silavên me ji milêtê Şara re, biçûk û mezin.
 
And our greetings to the people of Şara, big and small.

231
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:25,000
Eva ye bazara ye, bazara gundê Şara.
 
Here is the market, the market of Şara village.

232
00:21:25,000 --> 00:21:28,000
Xalo, apê Ibrahîm. Tu silava ji kê re dişînî?
 
Uncle, uncle Ibrahim. Who do you send greetings to?

233
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:31,000
Silava mi ji qîz û lawikê, apê Malîk re.
 
My greetings to the daughter and son, to uncle Malik.

234
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:36,000
Tu wan re silavan dişînî, xwedê ji we razî be, û seheta we
xweş be.
 
You send them greetings, may God be pleased with you, and
may your health be good.

235
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:42,000
Xwedê xêra we û wan qebûl bike, xwedê ji we razî be, saetên
xweş be.
 
May God accept your and their charity, may God be pleased
with you, good hours to you.

236
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:47,000
Ha va xêr û bereketa me. Me qeyda xwe çêkir, eva me.
 
Here is our charity and blessing. We made our record, this
is ours.

237
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:49,000
Bavê Ibrahîm te xêr kir.
 
Father of Ibrahim, you did a good deed.

238
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:58,000
Xwedê emrê we dirêj bike û xwedê we dîn û îmanê ji we mehrûm
neke. Em tim dia ji we re dikin û înşallah em ê xizmet
bikin.
 
May God prolong your life and may God not deprive you of
religion and faith. We always pray for you and God willing
we will serve.

239
00:21:58,000 --> 00:22:02,000
Xwedê destê we li ser van bigre, xwedê we mohtacî kesî neke.
 
May God keep your hands over these, may God not make you
need anyone.

240
00:22:02,000 --> 00:22:08,000
Mirov dikare bêje hewçend e. Em gav bi gav amade dikin, wekî
hûn dibînin.
 
One can say it's enough. We prepare it step by step, as you
can see.

241
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:13,000
Ê... ez ê herim der, binihêrim mantiqa vir çawa ye... Ew gor
in, ez ê binihêrim.
 
Uh... I will go outside, see how the area here is... Those
are graves, I will look.

242
00:22:13,000 --> 00:22:17,000
Em diçin rex mektebê, em diçin kêleka we mektebê.
 
We go next to the school, we go beside that school.

243
00:22:17,000 --> 00:22:21,000
Ev ê din, bazar jî li jêr e, ava dibe.
 
This other one, the market is also below, being built.

244
00:22:21,000 --> 00:22:24,000
Bavê Ebdo, ka tu jî tiştekî bêje.
 
Father of Ebdo, come on, you say something too.

245
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:30,000
Bavê Elî, ko tu nayê.
 
Father of Ali, you aren't coming.

246
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:32,000
Ez nayêm.
 
I'm not coming.

247
00:22:32,000 --> 00:22:35,000
De were tu bêje, ser xêrê...
 
Come on you say it, for goodness' sake...

248
00:22:35,000 --> 00:22:40,000
Hemû wek hevin...
 
They are all the same...

249
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:45,000
Ezê gora min çêkim, wisa ye.
 
I will make my grave, it's like that.

250
00:22:45,000 --> 00:22:51,000
Xalo ma we got ev e ablûka şemsî. Çima, ev e bazara ku hatî
çêkirin e?
 
Uncle, did you say this is the solar block. Why, is this the
market that was built?

251
00:22:51,000 --> 00:22:54,000
Yê berê ewan qebûl nedikir, paşê...
 
Those before didn't accept it, later...

252
00:22:54,000 --> 00:22:57,000
Me ew dî, dihate vê wateyê...
 
We saw that, it meant this...

253
00:22:57,000 --> 00:23:00,000
Ne ev bazara berê bû, wê çaxê wilo nedigotin...
 
No, this was the market before, at that time they didn't
call it like that...

254
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:04,000
Me av neda gulên vir, ka em bidin.
 
We didn't water the flowers here, let's give them.

255
00:23:04,000 --> 00:23:08,000
Qet ava ku vira maye nîne, av hişk bûye.
 
There is no water left here at all, the water has dried up.

256
00:23:08,000 --> 00:23:12,000
Heke mirov bide bîra xwe...
 
If one remembers...

257
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:17,000
Mentiqek mezin e, ka wêneyê wan bikişîne.
 
It's a great logic, take a photo of them.

258
00:23:17,000 --> 00:23:22,000
Maşallah, gundê Şara pir mezin e. Xalo qasî çend mal hene li
Şara?
 
Mashallah, the village of Şara is very big. Uncle, about how
many houses are there in Şara?

259
00:23:22,000 --> 00:23:25,000
Ser dused û pêncî mal e.
 
It's over two hundred and fifty houses.

260
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:26,000
Sêsed mal nîne?
 
Isn't it three hundred houses?

261
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:27,000
Hebe...
 
There might be...

262
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:29,000
Goristan a mezin e.
 
The cemetery is big.

263
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:31,000
Tirba kê ye ev?
 
Whose grave is this?

264
00:23:31,000 --> 00:23:34,000
Rehma xwedê lê be.
 
May God's mercy be upon him.

265
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:37,000
Dibe xwedê wî bixe cenetê.
 
May God put him in heaven.

266
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:41,000
Xwedê rehma xwe lê bike û bixe bihiştê.
 
May God have mercy on him and put him in heaven.

267
00:23:41,000 --> 00:23:47,000
Mirov pê diêşe... min dî...
 
One gets hurt by it... I saw...

268
00:23:47,000 --> 00:23:51,000
Kêla şehîdekî ye, maşallah.
 
It's a martyr's tombstone, mashallah.

269
00:23:51,000 --> 00:23:55,000
Hezarn nehsed û pêncî û şeş.
 
Nineteen hundred and fifty six.

270
00:23:55,000 --> 00:23:58,000
Xwedê rehma xwe lê ke. Cihê wî bihişt be.
 
May God have mercy on him. May his place be paradise.

271
00:23:58,000 --> 00:24:02,000
Ew çi dibê, ev e pêtê wî ye...
 
What does he say, this is his footstone...

272
00:24:02,000 --> 00:24:05,000
Ev kêla din, ya pêtê wî ye.
 
This other headstone, is of his foot.

273
00:24:05,000 --> 00:24:08,000
Ew jî jina birayê wî ye..
 
That is also his brother's wife..

274
00:24:08,000 --> 00:24:10,000
Ew jî xesûya wî ye.
 
That is also his mother-in-law.

275
00:24:10,000 --> 00:24:16,000
Xwedê rehma xwe li wa hemiya bike, cihê wan bihişt be.
 
May God have mercy on all of them, may their place be
paradise.

276
00:24:16,000 --> 00:24:18,000
Min got ezê hinek tişt amade bikim..
 
I said I will prepare some things..

277
00:24:18,000 --> 00:24:22,000
Min jî wekî te dî... min vîdyoya wan nedî..
 
I also saw like you... I didn't see their video..

278
00:24:22,000 --> 00:24:29,000
Min wek te dît firçe kiribû, bes me navên wan zelal kiribû.
 
I saw you had brushed it, but we had made their names clear.

279
00:24:29,000 --> 00:24:39,000
Me wehd dabû, me got gava em diçin goristanan, divê em navan
diyar bikin û çêkin, rast e?
 
We promised, we said when we go to cemeteries, we must
clarify and make the names, right?

280
00:24:39,000 --> 00:24:44,000
Rast e, em ev e ji bo wehda xwe dikin...
 
It's true, we are doing this for our promise...

281
00:24:44,000 --> 00:24:48,000
Bavê Ebdil, eva wezîfeya te ye.. Xwedê...
 
Father of Ebdil, this is your duty.. God...

282
00:24:48,000 --> 00:24:52,000
Te digot çima ew ji te dûr nabe...
 
You were saying why doesn't he get away from you...

283
00:24:52,000 --> 00:24:59,000
Nabe, wisa xweş nabe...
 
It can't be, it's not good like that...

284
00:24:59,000 --> 00:25:04,000
A xwedê te ew jî dîtin... ez neme diêşim..
 
By God you saw them too... I no longer hurt..

285
00:25:04,000 --> 00:25:07,000
Ew tişt, ya xwesiyê ye...
 
That thing, is of the mother-in-law...

286
00:25:07,000 --> 00:25:11,000
Ew ên din jî, ez.. te digo...
 
Those others too, I.. you were saying...

287
00:25:11,000 --> 00:25:15,000
Xwe bi xwe ez ê pêşiya gora xwe... çêdikim...
 
By myself I will make... the front of my grave...

288
00:25:15,000 --> 00:25:18,000
Pêşiya we, xwesî û xezûrê xwe dikin...
 
In front of you, make for the mother-in-law and father-in-
law...

289
00:25:18,000 --> 00:25:25,000
Em difikirin... pêşî ez ê gora xwesî û xezûrê xwe çêbikim...
 
We think... first I will make the grave of my mother-in-law
and father-in-law...

290
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:32,000
Bêjin em kêlê wan çêkin û her wiha ji xwe re jî amade bikin,
em gora xwe rakin...
 
Let's make their tombstones and also prepare for ourselves,
raise our grave...

291
00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:39,000
Na. Ew ne rehm e.. erê rehm e, rehma xwedê..
 
No. That's not mercy.. yes it's mercy, God's mercy..

292
00:25:39,000 --> 00:25:46,000
Xalo em dixwazin vana wek... kefen... navê xwe li ser..
 
Uncle we want these like... shroud... name on it..

293
00:25:46,000 --> 00:25:49,000
Te jî nedît.. me wî dî.
 
You didn't see either.. we saw him.

294
00:25:49,000 --> 00:25:55,000
Gotin çima weha ye... mi got ez natirsim, em yê xwe
çêbikin.. ma ne heram e?
 
They said why is it like this... I said I'm not afraid,
let's build ours.. isn't it haram?

295
00:25:55,000 --> 00:25:57,000
Na na ne haram e.
 
No no it's not haram.

296
00:25:57,000 --> 00:26:02,000
Tirba xaltîk te digo.. tu digo ewa kî ne.. yek li wî alî..
 
Aunt's grave you said.. you were saying who are they.. one
on that side..

297
00:26:02,000 --> 00:26:04,000
Yek ji wê alî.
 
One from that side.

298
00:26:04,000 --> 00:26:08,000
Û pêtên wan... wisa ew nîşan tê dan..
 
And their feet... they are marked like that..

299
00:26:08,000 --> 00:26:10,000
Bidin min...
 
Give to me...

300
00:26:10,000 --> 00:26:15,000
Em li wir... me qebûl e.. xwedî xêr bin..
 
We there... we accept.. be benefactors..

301
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:18,000
Tiştek min nîn e weleh.
 
I don't have anything by God.

302
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:21,000
E.. û ev ha dî.
 
And.. and saw this.

303
00:26:21,000 --> 00:26:26,000
Xwedê jê razî be... wilo.. em dizanin...
 
May God be pleased with him... like that.. we know...

304
00:26:26,000 --> 00:26:31,000
Her yekê ji aliyekî... bi vî rengî... yekê aliyek... wilo..
 
Everyone from a side... in this color... one side... like
that..

305
00:26:31,000 --> 00:26:33,000
Xwedê rehma xwe li wa hemiya bike..
 
May God have mercy on all of them..

306
00:26:33,000 --> 00:26:36,000
Em rûniştine û dia ji wan re dikin.
 
We are sitting and praying for them.

307
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:42,000
Xwedê qedrê we sax bike, xwedê we jî bixe rehmê û rîzqa xwe!
Xwedê heta sax in li we asan ke! Me di vê rojê da!
 
May God heal your value, may God put you in mercy and your
sustenance! May God make it easy for you as long as you
live! Us in this day!

308
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:44,000
Em nedîtin rojên wisa pîs, xwedê rabe pêşiya wan.
 
We didn't see such bad days, God stand before them.

309
00:26:44,000 --> 00:26:47,000
Da xwarê, wisa pêş ve.. dîsa hildan...
 
Put it down, like this forward.. picked it up again...

310
00:26:47,000 --> 00:26:51,000
Tiştê hûn dikin xêr e... ev rîzê wisa ne bi vî awayî bihişt
in..
 
The thing you do is a good deed... these rows are not like
this in heaven..

311
00:26:51,000 --> 00:26:54,000
Ebû Ibrahîm e ta wê derê, ne?
 
It is Abu Ibrahim up to there, isn't it?

312
00:26:54,000 --> 00:26:57,000
Xwedê rehma xwe li wan bike.
 
May God have mercy on them.

313
00:26:57,000 --> 00:26:58,000
Xwedê rehma xwe li wa bike. Cîhê wan cinet be.
 
May God have mercy on them. May their place be heaven.

314
00:26:58,000 --> 00:27:05,000
Av bidin wan hemuyan heya jêr e...
 
Water all of them down to the bottom...

315
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:08,000
Te nedî me hildan.. ma me av nedî wan.. me go hew nava xwe
dî, tiştek din e..
 
You didn't see we lifted.. didn't we water them.. we said he
just saw his middle, it's something else..

316
00:27:08,000 --> 00:27:11,000
Tu bibê... a wilo...
 
You say... like that...

317
00:27:11,000 --> 00:27:16,000
Bidin destar da em bikin kurmancî.
 
Give the handmill so we can make it Kurmanji.

318
00:27:16,000 --> 00:27:22,000
Tu nizanî, ev destar, em dixebitînin.
 
You don't know, this handmill, we use it.

319
00:27:22,000 --> 00:27:23,000
Şamî ye.
 
It's Damascene.

320
00:27:23,000 --> 00:27:31,000
A wilo. Berê me dî ewa wê dixe...
 
Like that. We saw before that he puts it...

321
00:27:31,000 --> 00:27:33,000
Destê te sax be av bide.
 
Bless your hand, water it.

322
00:27:33,000 --> 00:27:44,000
We di wî reşî de jî têkoşîn e...
 
You struggle in that darkness too...

323
00:27:44,000 --> 00:27:53,000
Heya jêr de har... jêr...
 
Until down to the bottom... down...

324
00:27:53,000 --> 00:28:00,000
Bes e.
 
It's enough.

325
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:04,000
Ko derva derket... ava têxe nav.
 
Since it came out... put water in.

326
00:28:04,000 --> 00:28:14,000
Hevdû te ne dî! Xwedê te jî tevlî me dî..
 
You didn't see each other! God saw you joining us too..

327
00:28:14,000 --> 00:28:24,000
Bêtir neke wê, yê ser wî dî, ev e ev tişt ha wê...
 
Don't do it more, saw the one on him, this is this thing yes
that...

328
00:28:24,000 --> 00:28:29,000
Heya wira..
 
Up to there..

329
00:28:29,000 --> 00:28:44,000
Ka êdî ev e...
 
So now this is...

330
00:28:44,000 --> 00:28:49,000
Ka devê... A wilo silav. Silav!
 
Where is the mouth of... Like that greetings. Greetings!

331
00:28:49,000 --> 00:28:58,000
Ev heval xalê te Izet dibîne, belê ji te ra... silava min
dibe... Almanyayê!
 
This friend sees your uncle Izet, yes to you... takes my
greetings... to Germany!

332
00:28:58,000 --> 00:29:05,000
Bêyî min tu tiştekî, te we dî, ne em in, ne! Ew in!
 
Without me you anything, you saw them, not us, no! It's
them!

333
00:29:05,000 --> 00:29:12,000
Em li vir nexweşin... Te silav ji min re şand.. em razî ne.
 
We are sick here... You sent greetings to me.. we are
content.

334
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:20,000
Em di wê da dibêjin wî birayê min wî dî yê din ne tiştek e..
ez tevlî te bûm... te şandin!
 
We say in it my brother saw him the other is nothing.. I
joined you... you sent!

335
00:29:20,000 --> 00:29:27,000
Êdî em wisa ne... yek bi yek tu dinêrî eşîra me, Xwedê rehma
xwe.
 
Now we are like this... one by one you look at our tribe,
God have mercy.

336
00:29:27,000 --> 00:29:37,000
Ne wilo derket.. ez.. ez bi xwe nabêjim.. te we nizanî bû wê
me.. wî şand min wî ew dî, ew çawa, em eşîret bûn.
 
It didn't come out like that.. I.. I don't say it myself..
you didn't know that us.. he sent him me he saw it, how he,
we were a tribe.

337
00:29:37,000 --> 00:29:47,000
Xalo em di vir da wî dibînin, em dizanin kekê te wî
dibînin... heqê wa di vir de dît e! Em li vir in!
 
Uncle we see him here, we know your brother sees him...
found their right here! We are here!

338
00:29:47,000 --> 00:29:51,000
Qet derneket e wisa!
 
It didn't come out like that at all!

339
00:29:51,000 --> 00:29:55,000
Te got çi teqilî me? Rabe ser wî karî...
 
You said what clashed with us? Get up to that work...

340
00:29:55,000 --> 00:30:00,000
Her yek heqê xwe... dît wî.
 
Each one his right... saw him.

341
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:09,000
Çaxê sora rind e me re êvaret... Tirbê xwe destî xwe bi kul
e, bi xwe çêke, tirbê xwe... Çaxê sora rind e.
 
When the red is nice for us in the evening... dig your grave
with your own hands, make your grave yourself... When the
red is nice.

342
00:30:09,000 --> 00:30:15,000
Êdî her kes hesaba xwe bike nişte, ev rûp şeveke ye ê.
 
Now everyone should do their own calculation, this face is a
night.

343
00:30:15,000 --> 00:30:17,000
Hesen kerem ke...
 
Hasan go ahead...

344
00:30:17,000 --> 00:30:27,000
Tirbê xwe bi xwe kulo, xetê te dirêj ke û derxîne û filan ke
û de kê û de kê rehmê te pê ne de dekê.
 
Dig your own grave, dig it yourself, make your line long and
take it out and so on, and do not expect mercy from anyone.

345
00:30:27,000 --> 00:30:30,000
Bi xwe kulo u ne de dekê xwe.
 
Dig it yourself and do not give it to anyone.

346
00:30:30,000 --> 00:30:32,000
Ê dê kê bo te kulo...
 
Who will dig it for you...

347
00:30:32,000 --> 00:30:41,000
Xilas... Ma dê kî niyet kirî ye ewê jê xwara? Xwedê zanê
jî... Belkî te kulo mirîyek din tê de bisekine.
 
Finished... Has anyone intended to eat from it? God knows...
Maybe you dig it and another dead person will stay in it.

348
00:30:41,000 --> 00:30:45,000
Wê ji xwe re kulo bî... Likê lê têk... Bêrîkî bimire...
 
You will dig it for yourself... Put a stone on it... Before
he dies...

349
00:30:45,000 --> 00:30:46,000
Xwedê rehma xwe lê ke, cihê wî cenet be.
 
May God have mercy on him, may his place be heaven.

350
00:30:46,000 --> 00:30:50,000
De... Meriv, ez di bibêjim yek vir be.
 
Well... Man, I say let one be here.

351
00:30:50,000 --> 00:30:52,000
Yek jî ki kî bi kulo.
 
And who will dig one.

352
00:30:52,000 --> 00:30:56,000
Heryek jî ki şkê. Ê wate be...
 
Let each one break it. Let it be like that...

353
00:30:56,000 --> 00:30:58,000
Ew navê kulo nîşan bide.
 
Show the name of the one who digs.

354
00:30:58,000 --> 00:31:00,000
Zirav têne... Ko her çû...
 
They come thin... When everyone goes...

355
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:07,000
